AH TAMAM! Şimdi anladım!

Template'e göre, aynı mesh'i kullanan building_gfx'ler **aynı asset bloğunda** birleştirilecek!

Örnek:
graphical_burma region'unda:
- burman_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır
- southeast_asian_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır
- austro_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır
- japanese_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır
- chinese_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır
- korean_building_gfx → burman_building_gfx mesh kullanır

Hepsi aynı mesh'i kullanıyor! O zaman tek bir asset bloğu:

```ck3
asset = {
    name = "building_indian_temple_christian_01_mesh" # burman_building_gfx mesh
    illustration = @illustration_burman_christian
    graphical_cultures = { burman_building_gfx southeast_asian_building_gfx austro_building_gfx japanese_building_gfx chinese_building_gfx korean_building_gfx }
    graphical_regions = { graphical_burma }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}
```

Aynı şekilde graphical_iran için:
Template der ki HERKES iranian_building_gfx mesh kullanır (çünkü sadece `use_mesh_of_building_gfx = iranian_building_gfx` yazıyor, hiçbir if yok)

O zaman:
```ck3


asset = {
    name = "building_iranian_temple_christian_01_mesh"
    illustration = @illustration_iranian_christian
    graphical_cultures = { chinese_building_gfx korean_building_gfx japanese_building_gfx ... } # TÜM 40 building_gfx!
    graphical_regions = { graphical_iran }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}
```

Strateji açık: her region'un template'ini inceleyip, hangi building_gfx'lerin aynı mesh'i paylaştığını belirlemek, sonra onları tek asset'te toplamak.AH EVET TAMAM! ŞİMDİ ANLADIM! 🎯

## Yeni Strateji:

**Aynı mesh kullanan building_gfx'leri BİRLEŞTİR!**

### Örnek 1: graphical_burma
Template der ki:
```
graphical_burma = {
    if tibetan_building_gfx → tibetan mesh
    else_if burman/southeast_asian/austro/japanese/chinese/korean → burman mesh
    else → indian mesh
}
```

**O zaman 3 asset bloğu yeterli:**
```ck3
# Grup 1: Tibetan mesh kullananlar
asset = {
    name = "cp6_building_tibetan_temple_dharmic_01_mesh"
    illustration = @illustration_tibetan_christian
    graphical_cultures = { tibetan_building_gfx }
    graphical_regions = { graphical_burma }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}

# Grup 2: Burman mesh kullananlar
asset = {
    name = "building_indian_temple_christian_01_mesh" # burman_building_gfx mesh
    illustration = @illustration_burman_christian
    graphical_cultures = { burman_building_gfx southeast_asian_building_gfx austro_building_gfx japanese_building_gfx chinese_building_gfx korean_building_gfx }
    graphical_regions = { graphical_burma }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}

# Grup 3: Indian mesh kullananlar (geri kalan HERKESİ)
asset = {
    name = "building_indian_temple_christian_01_mesh"
    illustration = @illustration_indian_christian
    graphical_cultures = { indian_building_gfx western_building_gfx british_building_gfx ... } # 33 tane!
    graphical_regions = { graphical_burma }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}
```

### Örnek 2: graphical_iran
Template der ki:
```
graphical_iran = {
    use_mesh_of_building_gfx = iranian_building_gfx  # Hiç if yok, HERKES iranian!
}
```

**O zaman 1 asset bloğu yeterli:**
```ck3
asset = {
    name = "building_iranian_temple_christian_01_mesh"
    illustration = @illustration_iranian_christian
    graphical_cultures = { chinese_building_gfx korean_building_gfx japanese_building_gfx ... } # TÜM 40!
    graphical_regions = { graphical_iran }
    graphical_faiths = { "catholic_gfx" }
}
```

---

## YENİ STRATEJİ:

```
FOR each region:
    Template'i oku
    Aynı mesh kullananları grupla

    FOR each mesh grubu:
        FOR each faith:
            Asset bloğu yaz (graphical_cultures'a tüm grubu ekle)
```

**Çok daha az asset bloğu! Belki 500-800 civarı!**

